#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/language/scan_op/index.rst:43
msgid ""
"Negative `dim` indices are normalized (Python-style). If `dst` is None, the "
"operation is performed in-place into `src`. Raises ValueError when `dim` is "
"out of bounds for `src.shape`. When `src.scope() == \"local.fragment\"`, "
"this delegates to `cumsum_fragment`; otherwise it emits the `tl.cumsum` "
"intrinsic."
msgstr ""

